    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n37570" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξοπ-ίσω</span></b> , Adv., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>I.</b> of Place (as always in <i><span class="en">
